e cost.","depends_on":["scn_silverspine_charts"]},{"id":"scn_dock_meeting","title":"Old Apprentices","summary":"Veya travels to Mistral Docks to pay the wind-debt her crossing has accrued and to find a pilot. Kael greets her warmly and offers to buy her charts, reminding her they were apprentices together. She refuses, and he lets her go with a veiled warning.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Veya wants to settle her wind-debt and secure passage without revealing her charts; Kael wants to acquire them.","conflict":"Kael's charm and his offer of recognition play on Veya's wish to be acknowledged, while she fears becoming like the Cartel leaders.","outcome":"Veya refuses to sell, making Kael her open rival, and she realises she can no longer trust the docks and needs allies.","depends_on":["scn_silverspine_charts","scn_mistral_ledger"]}]},{"id":"act_rising","title":"Breaking Routes","purpose":"rising_action","scenes":[{"id":"scn_hollow_refuge","title":"Grain and Secrets","summary":"Veya follows the grain trade to The Hollow, where Maris is hiding smuggled grain from the Cartel levy. Maris distrusts her at first, but the two trade wind-current knowledge for Maris's unmapped service corridors.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya seeks a hidden path off the Cartel-watched lanes; Maris seeks to keep her isle fed through the crisis.","conflict":"Maris trusts slowly and suspects Veya's charts will draw Cartel attention to the Hollow, while Veya's stubbornness makes her reluctant to share her findings.","outcome":"They form an alliance, and Maris agrees to guide Veya through the corridors in exchange for Veya's help reading safe wind windows for the smuggling runs.","depends_on":["scn_dock_meeting"]},{"id":"scn_enforcers_closing","title":"Cartel Enforcers","summary":"Cartel enforcers sent by Kael track the smuggling routes to the Hollow's windmills. Maris uses her pathfinding 